<view class="container">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">提醒设置</text>
    <text class="subtitle">开启后将接收对应的微信消息通知</text>
  </view>

  <view class="setting-list">
    <view class="setting-item">
      <view class="setting-left">
        <text class="setting-icon">📋</text>
        <view class="setting-text">
          <text class="setting-name">订餐提醒</text>
          <text class="setting-desc">每晚 20:00 提醒预订明天的餐</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{orderReminder}}" bindchange="onOrderReminderChange" color="#1890FF"/>
    </view>

    <view class="setting-item">
      <view class="setting-left">
        <text class="setting-icon">🍽️</text>
        <view class="setting-text">
          <text class="setting-name">用餐提醒</text>
          <text class="setting-desc">每次订餐时授权，开饭前提醒</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{mealReminder}}" bindchange="onMealReminderChange" color="#1890FF"/>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips-card">
    <text class="tips-title">温馨提示</text>
    <text class="tips-text">1. 开启提醒需要您授权微信订阅消息权限</text>
    <text class="tips-text">2. 订餐提醒：每晚 20:00 发送，仅提醒未订餐的用户</text>
    <text class="tips-text">3. 用餐提醒：每次订餐需重新授权</text>
    <text class="tips-text">4. 发送时间：早餐 7:30、午餐 11:30、晚餐 17:00</text>
    <text class="tips-text">5. 可在微信设置中管理订阅消息</text>
  </view>
</view>
